cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite the original publisher of any figure you use."
type: dataset
title: "US Data Centers by State: Every Published Count"
abstract: >
  Every published count of US data centers we could verify, side by side and by state: Data Center
  Map (via Pew Research), dcmap.us, Visual Capitalist, US Census County Business Patterns and JLARC,
  with what each source counts and the date it describes, plus data center electricity shares (EPRI,
  LBNL) and Virginia power, water, bill and jobs figures.
authors:
